    <string name="more_about">About and privacy</string>
    <string name="about_body">MyHealth keeps everything on this phone, encrypted. It has no internet permission, no account, no analytics and no crash reporting service. It is a personal record to support conversations with your doctor, not a medical device and not a diagnosis.</string>
